### 5. Characters

Write in the style of the character sections of Namuwiki''s [Bird That Drinks Blood/Characters](https://namu.wiki/w/%ED%94%BC%EB%A5%BC%20%EB%A7%88%EC%8B%9C%EB%8A%94%20%EC%83%88/%EB%93%B1%EC%9E%A5%EC%9D%B8%EB%AC%BC) and the officer entries of [Romance of the Three Kingdoms 13](https://namu.wiki/w/%EC%82%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%A7%80%2013). Separate rank from livelihood.

| Document | Description |
