### RWARFARE-40 Order of Succession

Succession is not decided by bloodline alone. Candidates are considered in the order below.

1. Designated heir
2. Deputy leader or proxy
3. Election and council nomination
4. Kin and adoptees
5. Priests and apprentices
6. Trade guild recommendation
7. Control of military strongholds

