Seoul fact: https://github.com/islee23520/seoul-dengoku/blob/3e3c03349eafaaf88347d119a4bdd0c6d44abc53/AGENTS.md#L61 distinguishes the 334-station movement graph, the three-station content of Area 1, and the 427-dong atlas. Surface adjacency is not a movement edge. Maintain the previously approved squad contract''s surface/underground layers, transfer and entrance nodes, and full-route legality checks. CK3 reference: depth-03-activities-travel-landless.md:273-375,475-482 covers the boundary between destination planning and the pathfinding engine, plus special adjacency data. Equating pathfinding algorithms with speed and cost is unproven.

