| Operation — Current Edition and Action Selection | d17.b11.authority.sealed​Selections[3].applicatio​n | "Each contract supplies authority, duration, duties, breach, ratification, expiry/death, conflict, and physical handoff clauses. No unconditional recall or automatic return is inferred." |
| Operation — Current Edition and Action Selection | d17.b11.authority.sealed​Selections[4].row | "D22" |
