## Sources and Scope of Reuse

The short quotations from the original, along with the PDF page numbers, printed page numbers, and text coordinates, are in `referenceEvidence` in formulas.json. The coordinates are 1-based rows and columns from per-page `pdftotext -layout` output, not figure coordinates. Read the following separately: "BASIC LIFT (ST × ST)/5" on PDF p. 18, "For complete table, see p. 550." on PDF p. 19, "If your roll is less than or equal" on PDF p. 10, and "Exceptions and special cases" on PDF p. 11. The original PDF and sheet images are not redistributed.

The Seoul grounds are actor-authority-labor.20261003.transitions for population, economy-owner.20261003.arrival for arrival, sp1.b79 for trust, sp1.b122 and sp1.b124–127 for negotiation, sp1.b119 and sp1.b121 for endpoints, and sp1.b13 and sp1.b93 for preventing re-application of results. The half-open reservation is the explicit response scope that allowed same-time transitions. Even if the data type model contains these rules, it does not approve the undetermined values, country-specific laws, or implementation across the whole design.

